diff --git a/launcher3/PATCHES.md b/launcher3/PATCHES.md
index e123838..e8f9e1e 100644
--- a/launcher3/PATCHES.md
+++ b/launcher3/PATCHES.md
@@ -25,3 +25,4 @@ Imported dirs: `src`, `src_ui_overrides`, `go` (minus `go/quickstep`), `res`, `p
 - `WallpaperOffsetInterpolator.setOffsetSafely`: calls `TjHooks.onWallpaperOffset` (W3b: the wallpaper patch over the power-menu area needs the current wallpaper x offset).
 - `Launcher.onCreate`: `TjHooks.watchState(mStateManager)` (D0: the power-menu wallpaper patch is shown only while the home screen is in the NORMAL state, not during All Apps / transitions, not over other apps).
 - `Launcher.dispatchTouchEvent` (AD4, 2026-11-06): calls `TjHooks.onTouch` first, then `super`. A passive observer (never consumes or alters an event) for the hidden page-flick entrance to Quickstep (`SecretEntrances.Flick`); it replaces nothing of the N3a removal: no two-finger gesture, only a count of alternating single-finger swipes that start on the settled home screen, switchable in Launcher control.
+- `views/OptionsPopupView.showDefaultOptions` (AE7, 2026-11-06): the long-press menu on the home screen (and the menu key) offers ONLY the Wallpapers entry; the stock Widgets and Home settings entries are no longer added (Tj: "it should show wallpapers only"). `onWidgetsClicked` / `startSettings` stay for ScrimView's accessibility actions.
